---
<CaseScreens presentation={{slug:'bear-claw-usa',title:'From the job to the quote.',intro:'The updated website connects product sizes, applications and company information with a dedicated quote request. Actual desktop and mobile captures, October 2026.',pages:pages.map(p=>({...p,url:'https://bear-claw-usa.vercel.app'+p.path,images:{desktop:`bear-claw-${p.key}-desktop`,mobile:`bear-claw-${p.key}-mobile`,tablet:`bear-claw-${p.key}-tablet`}}))}}/>

